                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Health care costs are skyrocketing right now.\n\nIn my home state of RI, insurers announced double-digit rate hikes for next year, and open enrollment starts November 1.\n\nThat\u2019s when families make choices about coverage, and hospitals set their budgets. They can\u2019t afford to wait. https://t.co/lGjlavqOV0",
