                "text": "I visited WellOne Health Center in Pascoag to discuss how #RI02 is feeling the urgency of incoming health care cuts from Washington.\n\nProviders & patients understand that we need to bring down costs and extend ACA tax credits that help 40k+ Rhode Islanders afford coverage. https://t.co/N0vXwygIoE",
